  "name": "Question 15",
  "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to $({cot}^{2}\u2061x+1)^{2}-2{csc}^{2}\u2061x+1?$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we recall the identities\n\n$$\n{cot}^{2}\u2061x+1={csc}^{2}\u2061x,\\,{csc}^{2}\u2061x-1={cot}^{2}\u2061x.\n$$\n\nThen, we simplify our expression using the above identities, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}({cot}^{2}\u2061x+1)^{2}-2{csc}^{2}\u2061x+1 & =({csc}^{2}\u2061x)^{2}-2\\cdot {csc}^{2}\u2061x\\cdot 1+{1}^{2} \\\\  & =({csc}^{2}\u2061x-1)^{2} \\\\  & =({cot}^{2}\u2061x)^{2} \\\\  & ={cot}^{4}\u2061x\\end{aligned}\n$$",
